  "index_test": "in-vitro-only",
  "index_test_evidence": "Median lethal concentration (LC50 ) (rat, inhalation, 4 h) and half maximal inhibitory concentration (IC50 ) (lung or bronchial cell, 24 h) data for 59 substances were obtained from the literature and by experiments. Cytotoxicity assays were performed on 44 substances with reported LC50 , but without IC50 , data to obtain the IC50 values.",
  "decision": "exclude",
  "reason": "The study uses in vitro cytotoxicity data from human lung epithelial cell lines to predict acute inhalation toxicity. It does not use whole, live non-human animals as the index test."
